    affiliation: Department of Management, Hansei University, Gunpo, Republic of Korea
  - family-names: Kim
    given-names: Dae-Yeol
    affiliation: >-
      Department of Electrical, Electronic and Computer Engineering,
      University of Ulsan, Ulsan, Republic of Korea
keywords:
  - distributed ledger technology
  - agent governance
  - federated learning
  - trustworthiness evaluation
  - auditability
